-// licence) at the names' size: widened, slanted a little more, 11 rows, the greys F E D 8 C
-// (work\etiquettes\police_cpp.py ttf).
+// being row 0), rendered from Saira Italic (Copyright 2020 The Saira Project Authors,
+// https://github.com/Omnibus-Type/Saira, SIL Open Font License 1.1) at the names' size: width axis 118,
+// weight 650, slanted a little more, 11 rows, the greys F E D 8 C (work\etiquettes\police_cpp.py saira).
+// The game's names look like New Rodin Bold (Fontworks, not free); Saira is the closest free face tried.
